# 📊 Big-O Cheat Sheet

| Operation                | Average Complexity |
| ------------------------ | -----------------: |
| List lookup              |               O(n) |
| Set lookup               |               O(1) |
| Dictionary lookup        |               O(1) |
| List append              |               O(1) |
| List insert at beginning |               O(n) |
| Sorting                  |         O(n log n) |

